now that  beyond the walls modern weaponry is  advancing rapidly weapons are already  capable of piercing the armored Titans  armor and soon titan powers will become  irrelevant in the face of modern  military technology and weaponry what if  the 145th King saw a glimpse of the  future and he knew that this would  happen and that once titan powers were  no longer effective at warfare  marlee and the rest of the world would  decide that the LD ins are no longer  needed and since their human rights are  being taken away they would eventually  all be eliminated so that their Titan  powers could never pose a threat to  anyone else what if Carl fritz saw a  vision of the future in which the LD n  people faced extinction at the hands of  the other nations and he decided that  the only way to save at least a portion  of the Aldea nation is to isolate it on  the island of parodies behind the three  walls that way even if all the LD ins on  the continent are eliminated at least a  portion of the alienation will survive  on the island of parodies this would  explain why Carl fritz actually created  all those colossal Titans it was not an  empty threat it was an insurance policy  in order to make sure that the cost of  invading the island would be far greater  than any potential reward this would  also explain why Carl Fritz named the  three walls after the three daughters of  Emir he did not think that Aldi in  history was sinful and shameful and he  did not think that the audience deserved  to die because of the sins of their  ancestors rather he respected Aldi in  history he honored the daughters of Emir  by naming the walls after them and his  main goal was to preserve as many LD  ends as possible this would also explain  the 145th Kings ideology and why every  member of the royal family who inherited  the founding titan decided not to  venture beyond the walls and not to help  the LD ends on the continent every  holder of the founding Titan inherits  the vision of the future that Carl fritz  saw and they realized that if they  allowed the LD ends on the island to go  beyond the walls and get involved into  the politics of the outside world this  will inevitably lead to a world war that  will bring about the destruction of all  the ldiots so in order to preserve at  least a portion of the LDN population  each holder of the founding titan is  prepared to sacrifice the other aliens  on the continent this also explains why  Carl Fritz erased the memories of the  outside world from every LDN behind the  walls by erasing their memories of the  outside world  Carl Fritz took away much of the  temptation for LD ends behind the walls  to try to leave as they began to believe  that there was nothing outside the walls  except for deadly Titans the LD ends  behind the walls had very little  motivation to learn about the outside  world and get involved in its affair  which made it less likely that the LD  ends on the island would become involved  in a war with the rest of the world that  would ultimately lead to their  destruction  Carl Fritz wasn't a pacifist because he  believed that the audience deserved to  perish due to the sins of their  ancestors he was a pacifist because he  believed that the only way to save at  least a portion of the Aldea nation from  the wrath of rival nations was to  isolate them and make it too costly for  anyone on the outside to interfere in  their affairs all the subsequent  founding title holders saw things the  same way because they knew that the  audience had no future if they actively  took on the rest of the world and  because resources on the island are  limited and because trying to help the  audience on the continent would lead to  a massive war with marley and  potentially other nations as well every  royal holder of the founding titan power  decided to abandon the other LD ends and  remain as isolated from the outside  world as possible they made this  difficult decision for the sake of  preventing the